OL,3,AThousands of jobs at Virgin Media O2 to
OL,4,Abe cut
OL,5,
OL,6,FVMO2 has billions of debt on its
OL,7,Fbalance sheet and is tackling
OL,8,Fcompetition from both smaller providers
OL,9,Fas well as giants like BT, which has
OL,10,Fagreed a deal to acquire rival
OL,11,FTalkTalk, a move which VMO2 has firmly
OL,12,Fopposed.
OL,14,FVMO2 declined to comment. The Prospect
OL,15,Funion, which represents VMO2 staff,
OL,16,Fsaid the cuts were "disappointing and
OL,17,Fvery unsettling".
